# TEST KEY, FOR DEVELOPMENT ONLY. IT IS PUBLIC: ANYONE CAN SIGN WITH IT.
#
# It signs locally built guest images so the development path (and the
# smoke boot) exercises the same signature checks as a release. Releases
# are signed in CI with the release key, from the release-signing
# environment's CREW_RELEASE_SIGNING_KEY secret, and `mix crew_image.sign
# --release` refuses this key. Never configure its public half
# (test-signing.pub) as CREW_RELEASE_PUBLIC_KEY outside development.
#
# Format: an ed25519 private key (the 32-byte seed, CrewProtocol.Auth's
# private key form), base64.
B0ql6JGATkADh9Cq+wXYbpImVcohJljajlpASXilZ9k=
